WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
I have a long neck.

2
00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:05.680
Who am I?

3
00:00:05.681 --> 00:00:14.257
I am a giraffe!

4
00:00:14.258 --> 00:00:17.621
I have a long trunk.

5
00:00:17.622 --> 00:00:19.753
Who am I?

6
00:00:19.754 --> 00:00:29.281
I am an elephant!

7
00:00:29.282 --> 00:00:32.832
I have many sharp teeth.

8
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:34.947
Who am I?

9
00:00:34.948 --> 00:00:42.179
I am an alligator!

10
00:00:42.186 --> 00:00:46.010
I have stripes on my body.

11
00:00:46.011 --> 00:00:47.837
Who am I?

12
00:00:47.838 --> 00:00:58.385
I am a zebra!

13
00:00:58.386 --> 00:01:01.946
I have a huge mouth.

14
00:01:01.947 --> 00:01:04.021
Who am I?

15
00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:11.042
I am a hippo!

16
00:01:11.043 --> 00:01:14.142
I have two humps.

17
00:01:14.143 --> 00:01:16.338
Who am I?

18
00:01:16.339 --> 00:01:25.658
I am a camel!

19
00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:29.033
I have colorful feathers.

20
00:01:29.034 --> 00:01:31.022
Who am I?

21
00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:41.588
I am a peacock!

22
00:01:41.589 --> 00:01:44.099
Who am I?

23
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:48.020
I am a balloon!

24
00:01:48.021 --> 00:01:53.771
I can see many animals in the zoo.

